[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403537902","pull_request_review_id":3301239612,"id":2403537902,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6PQxPu","diff_hunk":"@@ -1650,6 +1651,17 @@ void Viewport::_gui_show_tooltip_at(const Point2i &p_pos) {\n \t\treturn;\n \t}\n \n+\t// If no custom tooltip is set on the control, check if the viewport has one set\n+\tif (!base_tooltip && gui.custom_tooltip.is_valid()) {\n+\t\tNode *scene = gui.custom_tooltip->instantiate();","path":"scene/main/viewport.cpp","commit_id":"86b294f87216b9559514cb0afc98f940d1f5ebb2","original_commit_id":"25c0d59cdd0f44ab4c4b5a540a200efe5c993b59","user":{"login":"alliephante","id":112137107,"node_id":"U_kgDOBq8Tkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112137107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante","html_url":"https://github.com/alliephante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"As a note I'm not sure if this leads to a leak... \r\nI used https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/2d/tile_map_layer.cpp#L1631 as an example for this, and it doesn't clear the extra Control/Node2D in any way so if this leaks, then I think those would too (unless a missed something), but pointing it out as I am unsure!","created_at":"2025-10-03T23:04:59Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T23:04:59Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111232#discussion_r2403537902","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111232","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403537902"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111232#discussion_r2403537902"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111232"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403537902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1674,"original_line":1656,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":14,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403614524","pull_request_review_id":3301371064,"id":2403614524,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6PRD88","diff_hunk":"@@ -1650,6 +1651,17 @@ void Viewport::_gui_show_tooltip_at(const Point2i &p_pos) {\n \t\treturn;\n \t}\n \n+\t// If no custom tooltip is set on the control, check if the viewport has one set\n+\tif (!base_tooltip && gui.custom_tooltip.is_valid()) {\n+\t\tNode *scene = gui.custom_tooltip->instantiate();","path":"scene/main/viewport.cpp","commit_id":"86b294f87216b9559514cb0afc98f940d1f5ebb2","original_commit_id":"25c0d59cdd0f44ab4c4b5a540a200efe5c993b59","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This would be a memory leak if the cast to `Control` fails and it isn't assigned to `base_tooltip`, as that means it is never actually added to the scene tree. Notice that in `TileMapLayer::_scene_update_cell()` all code paths end up with the scene added to the scene tree with `add_child()`. \n\nYou may want to print an error message in this case too.","created_at":"2025-10-04T00:31:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T00:31:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111232#discussion_r2403614524","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111232","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403614524"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111232#discussion_r2403614524"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111232"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403614524/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1674,"original_line":1656,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2403537902,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":14,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403618061","pull_request_review_id":3301375457,"id":2403618061,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6PRE0N","diff_hunk":"@@ -1650,6 +1651,17 @@ void Viewport::_gui_show_tooltip_at(const Point2i &p_pos) {\n \t\treturn;\n \t}\n \n+\t// If no custom tooltip is set on the control, check if the viewport has one set\n+\tif (!base_tooltip && gui.custom_tooltip.is_valid()) {\n+\t\tNode *scene = gui.custom_tooltip->instantiate();","path":"scene/main/viewport.cpp","commit_id":"86b294f87216b9559514cb0afc98f940d1f5ebb2","original_commit_id":"25c0d59cdd0f44ab4c4b5a540a200efe5c993b59","user":{"login":"alliephante","id":112137107,"node_id":"U_kgDOBq8Tkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112137107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante","html_url":"https://github.com/alliephante","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alliephante/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Ah okay, and since the `*scene` itself gets added, it doesn't matter that the two control/node2d pointers aren't cleared since they are just pointers of the scene with a different type.\r\n\r\nI think changing it to this should work\r\n```cpp\r\n\t\tif (scene_as_control) {\r\n\t\t\tbase_tooltip = scene_as_control;\r\n\t\t\t// Set tooltip text of the root node so we can pass the text into the scene\r\n\t\t\tbase_tooltip->set_tooltip_text(gui.tooltip_text);\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\tERR_FAIL_EDMSG(\"Invalid scene for Viewport Custom Tooltip. Root node should extend Control.\");\r\n\t\t\tscene->queue_free(); \r\n\t\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI don't _think_ it's possible to actually reach this state, as `set_custom_tooltip` checks if the root node is a control, and the project setting value is set using that same method. But better to be sure with the check!","created_at":"2025-10-04T00:35:25Z","updated_at":"2025-10-04T00:40:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111232#discussion_r2403618061","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111232","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403618061"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111232#discussion_r2403618061"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111232"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2403618061/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1674,"original_line":1656,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2403537902,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":14,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2404134969","pull_request_review_id":3302048862,"id":2404134969,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6PTDA5","diff_hunk":"@@ -1650,6 +1651,17 @@ void Viewport::_gui_show_tooltip_at(const Point2i &p_pos) {\n \t\treturn;\n \t}\n \n+\t// If no custom tooltip is set on the control, check if the viewport has one set\n+\tif (!base_tooltip && gui.custom_tooltip.is_valid()) {\n+\t\tNode *scene = gui.custom_tooltip->instantiate();","path":"scene/main/viewport.cpp","commit_id":"86b294f87216b9559514cb0afc98f940d1f5ebb2","original_commit_id":"25c0d59cdd0f44ab4c4b5a540a200efe5c993b59","user":{"login":"alliephante","id":112137107,"node_id":"U_kgDOBq8Tkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112137107?v=4",